{
  "defaults": {
    "suite": "core",
    "limit": 120,
    "workers": 3,
    "judge_samples": 2,
    "min_valid_rate": 90,
    "max_tokens": 4096,
    "token_budget": 24000,
    "base_url": "https://your-openai-compatible-endpoint/v1",
    "api_key_env": "AQG_API_KEY"
  },
  "models": [
    {
      "name": "model-a",
      "model": "model-a"
    },
    {
      "name": "model-b",
      "model": "model-b",
      "base_url": "https://another-endpoint/v1"
    },
    {
      "note": "预算对照：同一模型放宽轮次，用来区分「预算太紧导致没收尾」和「模型真的不合规」",
      "name": "model-a-wide-budget",
      "model": "model-a",
      "max_rounds": 8,
      "token_budget": 16000
    },
    {
      "note": "推理型模型：思维链会先吃满 max_tokens，沿用 1024 会导致正文一个字都拿不到，被判成 Output_Truncated 不可信样本",
      "name": "model-a-reasoning",
      "model": "model-a",
      "max_tokens": 8192,
      "token_budget": 32000
    }
  ]
}
